        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tactical Pulse&quot; is a first-person simulation shooting game that combines highly realistic tactics, diverse weaponry, and a dynamic respiratory system. Crafted with the Unreal Engine 5, it boasts stunning graphics, realistic physics, and a highly interactive environment, immersing players in a tense and strategically deep battlefield. Here, wisdom and courage are equally important, with tactics and shooting interwoven. Come and challenge yourself! &quot;Tactical Pulse&quot; will bring you an unprecedented gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139610/extras/b0624e8191067c4db3056f738f09920e.avif?t=1771297981\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139610/extras_big/b0624e8191067c4db3056f738f09920e.avif?t=1771297981 width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139610/extras/7cc55118a809bf33462b7ebce3526998.avif?t=1771297981\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139610/extras_big/7cc55118a809bf33462b7ebce3526998.avif?t=1771297981 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
